/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Scalability: One of the most compelling aspects of trading is its scalability. In the world of trading, percentages reign supreme, which means the basic principles apply regardless of your account size. A 20% return on $100 requires the same skill and strategy as a 20% return on $1,000,000. This scalability allows you to start small and grow your capital over time as you hone your skills.)
/E (Scalability: One of the most compelling aspects of trading is its scalability. In the world of trading, percentages reign supreme, which means the basic principles apply regardless of your account size. A 20% return on $100 requires the same skill and strategy as a 20% return on $1,000,000. This scalability allows you to start small and grow your capital over time as you hone your skills.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [9]
