/E (For these reasons, I recommend using Robinhood for your first 3-4 months of trading. This period allows you to familiarize yourself with trading basics in a user-friendly environment. After this initial learning phase, consider transitioning to more robust platforms like Webull, E*TRADE, or ThinkOrSwim. These advanced platforms offer more sophisticated tools, better execution, and more reliable customer support, which become increasingly important as you develop your trading skills and strategies.)
