/T (They help you pick the right option for your trade. Want a wild ride? Go for high Delta. Want something more chill? Look for lower Gamma and Vega. But here's the real deal: I personally never look at them. Yeah, you heard that right. When I'm day trading and selecting a strike price, I keep it simple. I go for options that are just outside the money. It's like picking a seat at a concert - not too close to get blasted by the speakers, but close enough to catch a drumstick if the band throws one.)
