1433 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 3574 0 R
/ActualText (Importance in Breakouts: Volume is a critical factor when assessing the strength of a breakout. A breakout occurs when the price moves beyond a significant support or resistance level. For the breakout to be considered reliable, it should be accompanied by an increase in volume, indicating that the move has broad market participation.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1434 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
