/P 3579 0 R
/ActualText (Calm Before the Storm: Low volume during a price consolidation phase might indicate indecision among traders. This "quiet" period often precedes a significant move as traders and investors await a catalyst or signal to enter the market.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [12]
>>
