/T (Confirm the Pattern with Decreasing Volume as It Forms: Volume is a crucial aspect when confirming the falling wedge pattern. As the wedge forms, you should observe a general decrease in volume. This declining volume suggests that the selling pressure is diminishing, which often precedes a reversal. The reduction in volume can be seen as the market losing interest in the downward movement, setting the stage for a potential breakout to the upside. This decrease in volume is a key confirmation that the falling wedge pattern is valid and that a bullish reversal might be on the horizon.)
/E (Confirm the Pattern with Decreasing Volume as It Forms: Volume is a crucial aspect when confirming the falling wedge pattern. As the wedge forms, you should observe a general decrease in volume. This declining volume suggests that the selling pressure is diminishing, which often precedes a reversal. The reduction in volume can be seen as the market losing interest in the downward movement, setting the stage for a potential breakout to the upside. This decrease in volume is a key confirmation that the falling wedge pattern is valid and that a bullish reversal might be on the horizon.)
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
