/T (Profitable traders view market data objectively, without emotional attachment. They analyze price movements, volume, and patterns as neutral data points rather than through the lens of fear or greed. This objectivity is what allows them to make clear, rational decisions even in volatile market conditions. By reducing emotional stress, objective information processing leads to more consistent and profitable trading outcomes.)
