/T (One of the biggest risks in trading is the temptation to become reckless after a loss. The desire to "make up" losses with larger, riskier trades can be overwhelming but must be resisted at all costs. A single significant loss can devastate your trading account if you abandon discipline and sound risk management principles. Always adhere to your predefined risk management strategies, and avoid the emotional trap of trying to recover losses quickly.)
