2427 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Shifting Stop Losses After entering a trade, you might be tempted to move your stop-loss further away to avoid taking a loss. This behavior increases your risk exposure and can lead to significant losses if the market continues to move against you. By setting your stop-loss levels during the pre-trade analysis and committing to them, you can avoid this common mistake.)
/E (Shifting Stop Losses After entering a trade, you might be tempted to move your stop-loss further away to avoid taking a loss. This behavior increases your risk exposure and can lead to significant losses if the market continues to move against you. By setting your stop-loss levels during the pre-trade analysis and committing to them, you can avoid this common mistake.)
/Pg 96 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
2428 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Unrealistic Profit Targets Post-entry analysis often leads to overly optimistic price targets. This can result in missed exit opportunities and diminished profits as you wait for the market to reach an unrealistic goal. By setting your profit targets before entering the trade, based on objective analysis, you ensure that your expectations are grounded in reality.)
/E (Unrealistic Profit Targets Post-entry analysis often leads to overly optimistic price targets. This can result in missed exit opportunities and diminished profits as you wait for the market to reach an unrealistic goal. By setting your profit targets before entering the trade, based on objective analysis, you ensure that your expectations are grounded in reality.)
