/T (Objectivity in Trading Successful traders maintain a neutral stance toward both wins and losses. This objectivity is crucial for executing your strategy consistently, regardless of past outcomes. It's important to remember that your edge in trading lies in your system, not in the results of individual trades. By focusing on the process rather than the outcome of each trade, you can avoid the emotional highs and lows that come with the natural fluctuations of the market.)
