/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Unseen Variables Every trade you execute is influenced by countless unseen variables. These can range from large institutional moves and algorithmic trading to unexpected news events or economic shifts. These factors are often beyond your control and can dramatically impact the outcome of any single trade. Recognizing the presence of these unknowns is crucial for maintaining realistic expectations. By accepting that you cannot predict or control every aspect of the market, you can focus on what you can control: your strategy, risk management, and emotional discipline.)
