/T (Pattern Recognition Over Time While individual trades may seem random and unpredictable, patterns begin to emerge when you look at a larger number of trades over time. These patterns are the foundation of developing a consistent trading edge. By analyzing a sufficient number of trades, you can identify recurring trends and behaviors in the market that can inform your strategy. This long-term perspective allows you to refine your approach and increase the likelihood of consistent success, even if the outcome of any single trade is uncertain.)
