/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Statistical Approach to Trading The key to successful trading lies in viewing it as a series of probabilistic outcomes rather than as a collection of individual bets. This statistical approach helps you focus on the overall performance of your strategy instead of getting caught up in the results of single trades. By accepting that losses are a natural part of trading and that no strategy will win every time, you can maintain a more balanced and less emotional approach. Over time, the goal is to ensure that your winning trades outnumber or outweigh your losing ones, leading to consistent profitability.)
/E (Statistical Approach to Trading The key to successful trading lies in viewing it as a series of probabilistic outcomes rather than as a collection of individual bets. This statistical approach helps you focus on the overall performance of your strategy instead of getting caught up in the results of single trades. By accepting that losses are a natural part of trading and that no strategy will win every time, you can maintain a more balanced and less emotional approach. Over time, the goal is to ensure that your winning trades outnumber or outweigh your losing ones, leading to consistent profitability.)
