/T (Develop a Systematic Approach To minimize the impact of subjective perception, create a systematic approach to evaluating trade setups. This could involve a checklist of criteria that must be met before entering a trade, such as specific technical indicators, market conditions, and risk parameters. By consistently applying this checklist, you reduce the influence of biases and emotions, ensuring that your decisions are grounded in objective analysis.)
/E (Develop a Systematic Approach To minimize the impact of subjective perception, create a systematic approach to evaluating trade setups. This could involve a checklist of criteria that must be met before entering a trade, such as specific technical indicators, market conditions, and risk parameters. By consistently applying this checklist, you reduce the influence of biases and emotions, ensuring that your decisions are grounded in objective analysis.)
