/T (In the world of trading, simplicity often trumps complexity. Let's break down why keeping your approach straightforward is crucial for success: Streamlined Analysis: Resist the temptation to clutter your charts with numerous indicators. The only essential indicator you need is volume. Volume is the lifeblood of price movement and provides crucial insights into market sentiment and potential trend changes.)
