<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Pro Tip: Chart Inversion Here's a powerful technique many traders overlook: try inverting your charts. Flip them upside down to gain a completely different perspective. On Windows use Alt + I and on Mac use Option + I. This simple act can help you overcome the inherent "stocks only go up" bias many traders subconsciously hold. You might be surprised to find setups you previously missed when viewing the chart from this new angle.)
/E (Pro Tip: Chart Inversion Here's a powerful technique many traders overlook: try inverting your charts. Flip them upside down to gain a completely different perspective. On Windows use Alt + I and on Mac use Option + I. This simple act can help you overcome the inherent "stocks only go up" bias many traders subconsciously hold. You might be surprised to find setups you previously missed when viewing the chart from this new angle.)
